/*
:name: aeg_cost_sim
:type: lec
*/
// PYROPE-vs-PYROPE group, the fixture of the cost profile choice (pass/aegraph/cost/*.cost, milestone I): a divide
// by a constant has a multiply-shift alternative (div_mulshift8 / 16 / 31, rules/div.rules) that the `sim` profile
// prices below the divide (the LLVM backend emits a multiply-high; `lhd sim` is the target) and the default
// `synth` profile does not (the divider array specializes on a constant divisor and measured smaller than the
// multiplier of the magic constant). Whatever the profile picks must be equal to the classic reference.
// `aeg_cost_sim_1.prp` is the same source under the default profile, `aeg_cost_sim_2.prp` under `sim`.
pub comb top(a:U8, b:U16, s:S8) -> (q1:U5, q2:U15, q3:U6, q4:S8) {
  q1 = a / 10
  q2 = b / 3
  q3 = a / 7
  q4 = s / 3
}
